sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser as Browser / React
    participant Vercel as Vercel Frontend
    participant Axios as Axios API Client
    participant Render as Render / Spring Boot
    participant MySQL as Aiven MySQL

    Browser->>Vercel: GET / over HTTPS
    Vercel-->>Browser: HTML, JavaScript, CSS bundle
    Browser->>Axios: Render projects page; fetch project list
    Axios->>Render: GET /api/public/projects (HTTPS / JSON)
    Render->>Render: Security rules, controller, service
    Render->>MySQL: JDBC query using SQL
    MySQL-->>Render: Rows / mapped data
    Render-->>Axios: HTTP 200 + JSON response
    Axios-->>Browser: Parsed project data
    Browser->>Browser: Render project cards
